WEBVTT

00:16:27.965 --> 00:16:32.627
And I think the takeaway message
from that would be that Islam,

00:16:32.651 --> 00:16:35.183
despite some of the skeptics in the West,

00:16:35.207 --> 00:16:37.083
has the potential in itself

00:16:37.107 --> 00:16:40.686
to create its own way to democracy,
create its own way to liberalism,

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:42.246
create its own way to freedom.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:44.519
They just should be allowed
to work for that.

00:16:44.832 --> 00:16:45.996
Thanks so much.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:51.388
(Applause)